  "translation": "This afternoon, I set out from my home to go to the supermarket. There were many people inside the supermarket. We first went to the fruit section. Mom asked me what fruit I wanted to eat. I said I wanted to eat apples. So Mom bought a few catties of apples. Then we went to the vegetable section, where there were cabbage and tomatoes. Mom also bought other vegetables, and we also bought a piece of meat. At checkout, I paid, but Mom discovered she hadn't brought her wallet, and she was very sad. I said, \"Don't worry, I have money. I will pay.\" Mom smiled, and finally we went home. I felt very happy today, and Mom felt happy too."
